; One station-book entry.
FORM BOOK
TITLE Station book entry
SUMMARY Adds or changes one entry in the station book: a station, or a collective that sends to several.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 30
ACTION book_put
PREFILL book name
FIELD name Name(X) required upper max=40
FIELD kind Kind(STATION,COLLECTIVE) default=STATION
FIELD call Call(X) upper max=16 check=station
FIELD ri Routing indicator(AAAAAAA) upper
FIELD ale ALE address(X) upper max=15
FIELD members Members(X) upper
FIELD note Note(X) max=60
NEXT BOOK CHANNEL
BEGIN_HELP
Name:
What you call this station or group in messages: NET CONTROL, STA-B.
END

Members:
For a collective: the names or calls it sends to, separated by commas.
END

Note:
No personal details: no names, phone numbers or addresses. The book travels in startup bundles.
END
